## Architecture
SOLID · DRY · KISS · YAGNI · SoC · Fail Fast

## Project Structure
```
src/features/ · src/shared/ · src/config/ · src/types/
tests/ · docs/ · .env.example · README.md
```
Max 4 levels · Config at root

## Coding Standards
- Function ≤ 20 lines · File ≤ 300 lines
- camelCase vars · PascalCase components · SCREAMING_SNAKE constants · kebab-case files
- No magic numbers · No commented-out code · Prefer pure functions

## Security (Non-Negotiable)
```
❌ No hardcoded secrets · No logged PII · No unvalidated input
✅ Env vars · Validate+sanitize · Least privilege
```
```bash
npx ecc-agentshield scan
```

## Performance
Lazy load · Debounce 300ms · Cache aggressively · Batch requests · Measure first

## Testing
Arrange→Act→Assert · Coverage ≥ 80% · Test behavior not implementation

## Git
`feat|fix|refactor|docs|test|chore|perf(scope): description`
Atomic commits · No direct main · PR explains WHY

## Error Handling
```javascript
// ✅ Good
async function safeOp(input) {
  if (!isValid(input)) return { success: false, message: 'Please check your input' }
  try {
    return { success: true, data: await operation(input) }
  } catch (error) {
    logger.error('safeOp failed', { code: error.code })
    return { success: false, message: 'Something went wrong.' }
  }
}
```

## Accessibility
Semantic HTML · ARIA labels · Tab order · Contrast ≥ 4.5:1 · Mobile-first

## Priority
🔴 Security → 🟠 Critical bugs → 🟡 Minor bugs → 🟢 Features → 🔵 UI/UX → ⚪ Optimization

## Definition of Done
- [ ] Linting 0 errors · AgentShield pass · No secrets
- [ ] Feature works · Edge cases · Error/Loading/Empty states
- [ ] Tests pass · Regression tests for fixes
- [ ] Mobile responsive · Contrast ≥ 4.5:1
- [ ] README + .env.example updated

